<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When the Lord descends from heaven, then the morning bright will dawn,</l><l>This dark night will pass, and weeping will be o’er.</l><l>When the Lord descends from heaven, days of glory will begin;</l><l>Sighing and corruption gone forevermore.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>E’er the Lord will come from heaven, the bright morning star will shine,</l><l>Those who watch escape the trial, gain the prize.</l><l>Then the Lord will come and as the Sun of righteousness will reign;</l><l>Earth will be restored, God’s mercy realize.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Soon the Lord will come from heaven; may we watch and wait with prayer,</l><l>Loins be girt about, and lamps be burning bright.</l><l>Soon the Lord will come from heaven, may we serve Him faithfully,</l><l>Thus the ministry fulfill, our gifts incite.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
